<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Written by hand for the tests, shaped as requirements tools commonly export: headings by ReqIF.ChapterName,
     the standard ReqIF.* attributes, every datatype, an OLE object with a picture to fall back to, subscript the
     editor has no form for, and a tool extension an import passes over. -->
